CONCLUSION\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Axion Fabric v.24.4 is the ultimate expression of hardware-software co-design. By speaking directly to the silicon tiles, managing the processor's power states, and projecting memory across the network via RDMA, it achieves performance densities previously reserved for custom ASICs.\
